add('The fetch manifest records every attempted game ID, URL and failure. The notes parser validates final totals and deduplicates PBP overlaps. Source-code findings are based on the exact published Phase 5 commit, not a newly invented engine.\n')
add('From project root: node dev/run-phase6.cjs seasons; node dev/run-phase6.cjs diagnostic; python dev/phase6-analysis.py; python dev/phase6-model.py; python dev/phase6-statistics.py; python dev/verify-phase6.py; python dev/report-phase6.py. Completed outputs are retained/reused. Context, historical, save and instrumentation test commands are individual dev/phase6-*.cjs / test-phase6-*.cjs scripts. Preserve archived outputs before deliberately rerunning any dataset.\n')
